@startuml BandRental_Public_Seq

title Sequence Diagram - Band Rental (Public)

actor User
participant "Web App" as App
participant System
database Database

User -> App: Buka katalog band
App -> Database: Query daftar band available
Database --> App: Return band list
App --> User: Tampilkan katalog

User -> App: Pilih band
App -> Database: Query detail band + price
Database --> App: Return details
App --> User: Tampilkan detail

User -> App: Isi form rental (tanggal, durasi)
App -> System: Check availability
System -> Database: Query existing rentals
Database --> System: Return rentals
System -> System: Check conflict
System --> App: Available atau not

alt Tersedia
  App --> User: Show total harga
else Tidak tersedia
  App --> User: Show error + alternatives
end

User -> App: Klik "Checkout"
User -> App: Isi data penyewa + payment method
App --> User: Show ringkasan order

User -> App: Klik "Confirm & Pay"
App -> System: Process payment
System --> App: Payment success/fail

alt Payment berhasil
  System -> Database: Create rental record
  System -> Database: Update band availability
  System -> App: Send confirmation email
  App --> User: Show confirmation code
else Payment gagal
  App --> User: Show error message
end

@enduml
